Meta.documentation:match
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Tests a value against a field-pattern given in the URI.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The URI parameters encode the predicate: field=value pairs ANDed with "&",
Meta.documentation:"," separates OR alternatives within a field. Field names are dotted paths
Meta.documentation:into the value (headers.host digs into .headers.host); an empty field compares
Meta.documentation:the value itself. A "|name" suffix on the field applies a normalizer before
Meta.documentation:comparison ("portless": strips a trailing :port and [] brackets). A field whose
Meta.documentation:name (or last segment) is "host" always compares portlessly - the port is not
Meta.documentation:part of a host.
Meta.documentation:Emits one Boolean per incoming value.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:String:GET>>match:?=GET>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:true
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:String:localhost%3A8080>>match:?|portless=localhost,127.0.0.1,::1>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:true
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_default_$all - a String value to test
Meta.documentation:@port in_Data_default_$all - a Data value to test
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_default_$all - a Number value to test
Meta.documentation:@port in_Boolean_default_$all - a Boolean value to test
Meta.documentation:@port in_octetstream_default_$all - raw bytes to test
Meta.documentation:@port in_request_headers_$all - httpServer request meta ({method,url,headers})
Meta.documentation:@port in_httpConnection_$all - an httpConnection value (meta on its .value)
Meta.documentation:@port out_Boolean_default - true when the value matches the pattern
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status experimental

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20match%3A%3Ffield%3Dvalue%26field2%3Da%2Cb%20%20%E2%80%94%20AND%20of%20field%20equalities%2C%20OR%20within%20a%20field%2C%0A%2F%2F%20dotted%20field%20paths%2C%20%7Cnormalizer%20suffix%20on%20the%20field%20name.%0A%2F%2F%20Emits%20out_Boolean_default%20per%20incoming%20value%20and%20threads%20returns%20(reply%20chains).%0Afunction%20match()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22match%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%20%3D%20matchProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Aconst%20normalizers%20%3D%0A%7B%0A%09portless%3A%20function(v)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09return%20String(v).replace(%2F%5C%5B%7C%5C%5D%2Fg%2C%22%22).replace(%2F%3A%5Cd%2B%24%2F%2C%22%22)%3B%0A%09%7D%0A%7D%3B%0A%0Afunction%20matchProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09this.out_Boolean_default%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%0A%09function%20dig(value%2C%20path)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09if%20(value%20%26%26%20value.get_resource)%20value%20%3D%20value.get_resource().value%3B%0A%09%09if%20(!path)%20return%20value%3B%0A%09%09for%20(const%20key%20of%20path.split(%22.%22))%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09if%20(value%20%3D%3D%20null)%20return%20undefined%3B%0A%09%09%09value%20%3D%20value%5Bkey%5D%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09return%20value%3B%0A%09%7D%0A%0A%09this.in_instanciate%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09let%20newObject%20%3D%20this.get_resource().clone()%3B%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20input.value%20is%20the%20raw%20URI%20tail%2C%20e.g.%20%22%3Fmethod%3DGET%26headers.host%7Cportless%3Dlocalhost%3B127.0.0.1%22%0A%09%09let%20tail%20%3D%20(input%20%26%26%20input.value%20%7C%7C%20%22%22).replace(%2F%5E%5C%3F%2F%2C%22%22)%3B%0A%09%09newObject.tests%20%3D%20tail.split(%22%26%22).filter(v%20%3D%3E%20v!%3D%3D%22%22).map(function(part)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09const%20eq%20%3D%20part.indexOf(%22%3D%22)%3B%0A%09%09%09let%20field%20%3D%20decodeURIComponent(part.slice(0%2C%20eq))%3B%0A%09%09%09const%20values%20%3D%20decodeURIComponent(part.slice(eq%2B1)).split(%22%2C%22)%3B%0A%09%09%09let%20normalizer%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09%09%09const%20pipe%20%3D%20field.indexOf(%22%7C%22)%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(pipe%20!%3D%3D%20-1)%0A%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09normalizer%20%3D%20normalizers%5Bfield.slice(pipe%2B1)%5D%20%7C%7C%20null%3B%0A%09%09%09%09field%20%3D%20field.slice(0%2C%20pipe)%3B%0A%09%09%09%7D%0A%09%09%09return%20%7B%20field%3A%20field%2C%20values%3A%20values%2C%20normalizer%3A%20normalizer%20%7D%3B%0A%09%09%7D)%3B%0A%09%09return%20newObject.instanciate_processor()%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09this.test%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09let%20ok%20%3D%20true%3B%0A%09%09const%20tests%20%3D%20this.get_resource().tests%20%7C%7C%20%5B%5D%3B%0A%09%09for%20(const%20t%20of%20tests)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09let%20v%20%3D%20dig(input%20!%3D%3D%20undefined%20%26%26%20input.value%20!%3D%3D%20undefined%20%3F%20input.value%20%3A%20input%2C%20t.field)%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(v%20%26%26%20v.get_resource)%20v%20%3D%20v.get_resource().value%3B%0A%09%09%09%2F%2F%20host%20fields%20always%20compare%20by%20name%3A%20the%20port%20is%20not%20part%20of%20a%20host%0A%09%09%09if%20(t.normalizer)%20v%20%3D%20t.normalizer(v)%3B%0A%09%09%09else%20if%20(t.field%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22host%22%20%7C%7C%20t.field.endsWith(%22.host%22))%20v%20%3D%20normalizers.portless(v)%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(!t.values.includes(String(v)))%20%7B%20ok%20%3D%20false%3B%20break%3B%20%7D%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09return%20this.out_Boolean_default%3F.(%7B%20value%3A%20ok%20%7D)%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%09%2F%2F%20typed%20catchalls%20%3D%20the%20binding%20surface%20(in_%3CType%3E_%24all%20matching%20convention)%0A%09const%20self%20%3D%20this%3B%0A%09this.in_String_default_%24all%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20function(input)%20%7B%20self.test(input)%3B%20%7D%3B%0A%09this.in_Data_default_%24all%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20function(input)%20%7B%20self.test(input)%3B%20%7D%3B%0A%09this.in_Number_default_%24all%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20function(input)%20%7B%20self.test(input)%3B%20%7D%3B%0A%09this.in_Boolean_default_%24all%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20function(input)%20%7B%20self.test(input)%3B%20%7D%3B%0A%09this.in_octetstream_default_%24all%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20function(input)%20%7B%20self.test(input)%3B%20%7D%3B%0A%09%2F%2F%20request%20meta%20(%7Bmethod%2Curl%2Cheaders%7D)%20arrives%20on%20httpServer's%20out_request_headers%0A%09this.in_request_headers_%24all%20%3D%20function(input)%20%7B%20self.test(input)%3B%20%7D%3B%0A%09%2F%2F%20or%20as%20an%20httpConnection%20value%20on%20out_httpConnection%20(meta%20on%20its%20.value)%0A%09this.in_httpConnection_%24all%20%3D%20function(input)%20%7B%20return%20self.test(input)%3B%20%7D%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0Amatch.Processor%3DmatchProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%3Dmatch%3B]>>NewResource:match